  (n = samples: the cleared book's own, or what the door adds. Cohort is the PREVIOUS cutoff's stocks, backstopped at the index's own 5y CAGR. `excess`/`bar` are the UNCAPPED book; (#330) the `ship` verdict decides and is read at top10 (excess/worst), the published basket — excess >= that column's `bar`, the p95 of 200 same-n refused cohorts entered at the cohort's own ranks, AND worst >= cleared -1.0, at 20y, 12y and 8y. `inert` = the door's names never reach the published basket)
  all entries (SIZED)          book +6.0%/yr  excess -0.6  win 36%  worst -6.9  OOS -0.4/-0.7   (windows 39, deployed 100%) [diagnostic: the book `size` funds, top-25; remainder earns the index]

